    "CharacterAdvancement entry grants 300577 (only SkillLineAbility 91165 with AcquireMethod 0 lists it), so it is",
    "learned here as a fixture. Expected: maximum mana x1.06, melee and Fire spell critical strike chance +3",
    "percentage points, and all of it removed with the passive."
